        <item>
            <title>2.14.2</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 18:28:58 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>85</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.14.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes

- The sidebar no longer keeps showing the background-task indicator after the task has finished. Previously a session that went quiet right after launching a background task held that state until you typed in it again — in one case for 32 minutes with nothing running. Canopy now re-checks on its own while the session is idle.
- Background agents are detected again. Agents now run in the background by default, and Canopy was only recognising the ones launched with an explicit flag — so a growing share of them showed no background indicator at all, and their row in the activity list was marked finished the moment it started. Canopy now recognises them from the launch acknowledgement itself.
]]></description>
