        <item>
            <title>2.14.1</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 12:25:03 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>84</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.14.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- The MacroPad's LED colours for two states were retuned. A session that is generating is now **cyan** (was blue), and a session running a background task is now **blue-violet** (was spring green). The matching sidebar dots moved with them, so a key and its row still show the same colour for the same state.
- The change widens the smallest gap between neighbouring state colours from 38° to 60° on the hue circle, which makes the two "busy but not your turn" states easier to tell apart at a glance.
]]></description>
