        <item>
            <title>2.14.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 11:01:44 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>83</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.14.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- The sidebar footer now shows a small MacroPad link indicator. It stays a quiet outline while no pad is connected, fills in once one answers, and turns orange when the board is running but its NeoKey is not responding — the one hardware fault the pad's own LEDs cannot report, because there are no LEDs to report it with. Hover for the key count.
- Turning off **Enable MacroPad** in Settings hides the indicator entirely.

### Changes
- Reworded the MacroPad section footer in Settings, which previously said Canopy was unaffected without a pad attached.
]]></description>
